{"ref":"BDB, גּוּר⁴","hw":"גּוּר⁴","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">Ez 19:3</a></sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">5</a> <strong>whelp, young</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּר(אַרְיֵה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:9\" href=\"/Genesis.49.9\">Gn 49:9</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.2\">Ez 19:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">Ez 19:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוּרֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">La 4:3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  lion’s <em>whelps</em>, fig. of Judah <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:9\" href=\"/Genesis.49.9\">Gn 49:9</a>; of Dan <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.22\">Dt 33:22</a>; of Assyrian (prince?) <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:12\" href=\"/Nahum.2.12\">Na 2:12</a>; fig. of Israelites <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.2\">Ez 19:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִיר</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  young of jackals <span dir=\"rtl\">(תַּנִּין)</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">La 4:3</a>.","next":"BDB, גּוּר⁵","prev":"BDB, גּוֹר"}